    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>Represents one response (or page), along with its URL.

:param encoding: the encoding to decode the given content.
:param url: the URL from which the HTML was downloaded.
:param cache_link_parsing: whether links parsed from this page&apos;s url
                           should be cached. PyPI index urls should
                           have this set to False, for example.
</verbatim> </para>
